#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/index.rst:15
msgid "Static Code Analysis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/index.rst:17
msgid "**Automated code analysis without hassle!**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"Static analysis became an important part of software development cycle. It "
"can identify potential bugs, vulnerabilities and security threats by doing "
"an analysis on the source code level without having to test it on hardware "
"or execute any code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Static Code Analysis** helps reduce development cost by enabling engineers "
"to detect the precise location of defects and eliminate issues more "
"efficiently and earlier in the development cycle. It can also ensure "
"compliance with internal or industry coding standards such as MISRA, CERT, "
"etc."
msgstr ""

